      {
        "id": 211294,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-21T19:16:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I liked the joke back when they were more creative in how they altered the brand names. Even Denny's and IHIP was still pretty entertaining.</p><p>As for the Thorathian deal, for me it was more a feeling of oh yeah, there really isn't a reason why humans should be the only species in the galaxy to have races. (Or racism, for that matter.)</p><p>Interesting that it means Sky-Scraper may effectively be a Defector from Decadence, though, to borrow the TV Tropes term.</p>",
