        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Interesting that it means Sky-Scraper may effectively be a Defector from Decadence, though, to borrow the TV Tropes term.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That's what I thought that Skyscraper was a member of the dominant red skinned thorathians who joined the resistance. But that's not necessarily true now, the resistance could have bred her and trained her from birth to work for them</p>",
