        "created_at": "2017-12-22T00:02:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I liked the joke back when they were more creative in how they altered the brand names. Even Denny's and IHIP was still pretty entertaining.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Amen. Although I don't mind and actually enjoy Shmoctor Shmoo and the like, my favorites were back in the days of Toditos and Tony Bobbins. And probably other one that didn't start with T.</p>",
