        "created_at": "2017-12-22T10:24:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’d rather let them do their schtick and I’m sure the silly trademark obscuring will come back up. &nbsp; As to Smoctor Schmoo specifically that one is on Matchstickman. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I didn't do it alone, I had help from a typo.</p>",
