        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-25T04:24:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I enjoy when they talk to each other about how their&nbsp;world works. It give insight on they make stuff up and what their might set is when they create things. It also show that the creator doesn't always agree on things and end up coming to a middle ground. I need to relisiten to the letter page. I am starting to&nbsp;forget details&nbsp;about it.</p>",
